# Interim stable-file scope for CHECKSUMS.sha256.
#
# This list intentionally excludes evolving journal-candidate documents,
# generated figures, workflow artifacts, and development-only validators.
# The final tagged release must use:
#   python python/build_checksum_manifest.py --all-tracked --write
# and must archive that complete manifest with the exact release commit.
